{"id":"n57277-1-10","stage":0,"title":"그리다 · 画","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57277-1-10-1","ko":"우리 아이는 그림 그리는 것을 좋아해요.","zh":"我们的孩子很喜欢画画。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이는","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그림","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그리는","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것을","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해요.","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/43dc7b9b77eeedf7ff88.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57277-1-10-2","ko":"앞으로 화가가 될지도 모르겠네요.","zh":"说不定将来能成为画家呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화가가","meaning":"画家","explanation":"화가：画家；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73228","senseId":"1","lemma":"화가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될지도","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠네요.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"b04487b70213c84b","term":"화가","zh":"画家","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3","entryId":"73228","definition":"专业画画的人。","pronunciation":["화ː가"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b4c4bd26bcef5ef1a5e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57277","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":23,"sequenceScore":1.1188,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们的孩子很喜欢画画。","说不定将来能成为画家呢。","这个钱包是你的吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们的孩子很喜欢画画。","说不定将来能成为画家呢。","这个钱包是你的吗？"],"answer":1}]}
